flowchart TB

UI[Cloud Journey UI / Cloud Compass UI]

Agent[AI Assistant Agent]

MCP[Cloud Services MCP Server]

Workflow[Durable Journey State Machine]

Domain[Cloud Journey Domain Services]

DB[(Cloud Journey Database<br/>CJ Data + Locally Referenced STS Insights Data)]

Events[(Event Bus / Outbox)]

Checklist[Checklist & Readiness Service]

Adapters[Integration Adapter Layer]

STSBigQuery[(STS Insights BigQuery<br/>Including Jira Data)]

MyAccess[MyAccess]

Provision[Provisioning Platform]


UI --> Agent

Agent --> MCP

MCP --> Domain

Domain --> DB

Domain --> Events

Events --> Workflow

Workflow --> Domain

Workflow --> Checklist

Checklist --> Domain

Workflow --> Adapters

Adapters --> STSBigQuery

Adapters --> MyAccess

Adapters --> Provision